1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,400
The audience has long scattered. But a role played for a lifetime cannot end until the final breath.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Master, I got the tickets! It's the last boat, we have to hurry!

3
00:00:15,069 --> 00:00:18,069
The show is over! The Japanese are breaching the city!

4
00:00:21,069 --> 00:00:24,069
The Hegemon-King never crosses the river east.

5
00:00:24,069 --> 00:00:30,066
This turn is a final farewell. The pride of a master would rather break than flee south.

6
00:00:30,138 --> 00:00:39,141
He sang of heroes and empires his whole life. Now, the play becomes reality. The honor of this stage must finally be forged in blood.

7
00:00:39,138 --> 00:00:42,138
Take this prop blade. Go south, and finish the play for me.

8
00:00:55,207 --> 00:00:57,207
Yaaah—!
